+        "lies in the kernel of the hidden three-row coloring map; without that "
+        "invariant one must recover the eight graph-cover fibres globally."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: exact GF(2) (-1)-eigenspace recovery of the K8-cover fibres "
+        "is polynomial (packed Gaussian elimination, O(n^3/word_size)); across "
+        "eight shipping n=1024 instances it used 15,757,327 packed exact "
