+`verify` returns `(True, "ok")`. Replacing the second matrix row by a
+copy of the first returns `(False, "the three matrix rows must be linearly
+independent")`. This 16-vertex demo is genuinely hand-scale: a person can
+multiply five-bit vectors and check its 56 edges and 16 neighborhoods.
