    57	14: 01000
    58	15: 10001
    59	
    60	Adjacency lists:
    61	0: 5 8 9 11 12 13 14
    62	1: 3 5 6 9 12 13 14
    63	2: 3 4 5 7 8 11 12
    64	3: 1 2 4 6 7 10 15
    65	4: 2 3 6 10 11 13 15
